: We will pay the expenses that You incur towards reasonable fees of Architects, Surveyors and Consulting Engineers as follows: 

   - i. The fees are paid for preparing plans, specification tenders and quantities, and services in connection with the superintendence of the reinstatement of the Insured Building, Machinery, Accessories or Equipment; 

   - ii. The maximum We pay is 3 % of the claim amount; 

   - iii. We do not cover fees or costs for preparing any claim or estimate of loss or damage by the Insured Perils.
